// =============================================================================
// Bluetooth Classic RFCOMM server
// =============================================================================

/// Starts an RFCOMM service using the supplied UUID. Busy while a server is already
/// running: stop it first to change its name or UUID. Incoming links are
/// authenticated and encrypted (secure RFCOMM), except on macOS, which has no API
