/// A value expires 30 seconds after its callback was queued. At most 256 LE read and
/// notification values are held, past that the oldest is dropped; a server write
/// value is freed with its request (see bluetooth_le_server_respond_write); a
/// Classic value counts toward its connection's 1 MiB (see bluetooth_classic_connect).
