// =============================================================================
// BLE GATT server (peripheral)
// =============================================================================

/// Starts the GATT server. Busy while it runs.
/// on_connected(connection, device) fires when a central connects; connection is the
/// server connection handle its requests carry. Windows reports a central on its first
