/// value; a long write split by the central arrives assembled, at the offset of its
/// first part. response_needed is false for a write without response; Apple does not
/// say, and reports true. Fetch value with bluetooth_value_fetch(), then answer with
/// bluetooth_le_server_respond_write(), which frees it. A write without response keeps
/// its request and value for 5 seconds.
