function bluetooth_le_server_stop(): gmval;

[global, bind = typed_gml]
function bluetooth_le_server_is_running(): bool;

/// Adds a typed primary GATT service definition to the local peripheral/server.
/// OperationFailed while the server is not running; Busy for a service UUID already
/// added.
/// callback(error_code, message, service), service the server service handle (0 on
/// failure). Walk it with bluetooth_le_characteristic_get_count/get_at/find and
/// bluetooth_le_descriptor_get_count/get_at/find: they list its characteristics and
/// descriptors in definition order, a Client Characteristic Configuration descriptor
